    <briefdescription>
<para>Execution-time patch combining direct interior columns with temporary ghosts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The block, plan, and ghost vector must outlive this view. On stolen work the interior columns are received buffers rather than local allocation views. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
